WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.650
1. Fold corner to corner into a triangle

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:36.050
2. Unfold and fold the other diagonal

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:57.050
3. Unfold and fold edge to edge into a rectangle

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:12.450
4. Unfold, fold in half the other way, and reopen

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:58.050
5. Fold all four corners to the center

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.650
6. Flip the folded square over

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:38.250
7. Fold all four corners to the center again

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:58.050
8. Crease the small square in half both ways

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:12.800
9. Open the four pockets into a fortune teller
